### Access Role Management UI
# NOTE: Replace the token value with your configured RoleManagement:AccessToken from environment or appsettings.json
GET {{Forge.Api_HostAddress}}/role-management?t={{RoleManagement_AccessToken}}


### EmailSender
GET http://localhost:8300/version
Accept: application/json
X-Calling-Service: {{CallingService}}

### Emailsender text
POST http://localhost:8300/api/email/text
Content-Type: application/json
X-Calling-Service: {{CallingService}}

{
  "sender": "senderAAA@vsb.cz",
  "subject": "TestEail",
  "receivers": [
    "receiverA@vsb.cz"
  ],
  "cc": null,
  "bcc": null,
  "bodyText": "Jadi jada nada.",
  "priority": 0
}


### Userorg api/projectResource
GET {{Forge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Location
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Forge.Api_Bearer_AccessToken}}
X-Calling-Service: {{CallingService}}

### Userorg api/projectResource
GET {{Forge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/ProjectResource
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Forge.Api_Bearer_AccessToken}}
X-Calling-Service: {{CallingService}}

### Userorg api/Location
GET {{Forge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/Location
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Forge.Api_Bearer_AccessToken}}
X-Calling-Service: {{CallingService}}


### Userorg userinfo test
GET {{Forge.Api_HostAddress}}/api/UserInfo
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{Forge.Api_Bearer_AccessToken}}
X-Calling-Service: {{CallingService}}

### Userorg userinfo test
GET {{Forge.Api_HostAddress}}/userorg/api/UserInfo
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Service {{Forge.Api_AccessToken}}
X-Calling-Service: {{CallingService}}
